```

Then prompt Copilot with **this exact text**:

```text
You are a senior security engineer.

Implement a clock-based wallet unlock system with the following rules:
- One user-defined daily unlock time
- Unlock secret derived from hour + minute
- Secret is hashed and never stored in plain text
- Compatible with wallet-core encryption
- No UI logic
- No network calls
- TypeScript only
- Add clear inline documentation
```

Then continue with:

```
Nomad/security/recovery.ts
Nomad/security/lockout.ts
```

